%F A402482 G.f.: Sum_{k>=1} Product_{j=1..k} x^(2*j)/((1 - x^(4*j))*(1 - x^(4*j-1))*(1 - x^(4*j-2))*(1 - x^(4*j-3))).
%F A402482 a(n) ~ c * d^sqrt(n) / n^(3/4), where d = 9.547431094458685501223... (the same as in A402471) and c = 0.09166499810460998985...
%t A402482 nmax = 60; CoefficientList[Series[Sum[x^(k*(k+1))/Product[1-x^j, {j, 1, 4*k}], {k, 1, Sqrt[nmax]}], {x, 0, nmax}], x]
